            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yoly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very good. I only made half the recipe because of its high calorie count. I'm sorry I did that since this smoothie is delicious! Thanks for sharing your recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2022-07-24T19:04:48.601Z"
          },
          {
